   "d": "2022-01-25",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY21",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "We are therefore delighted to report that we expect to exceed market expectations for 2021 and that our gross profits and EBITDA levels continue to be strong.",
   "file": "20220125_ELCO_Year-end-trading-update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-03-31",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "While this is expected to reduce the revenues we report relating to perpetual licences moving forward, our Recurring Revenues will increase, creating strong visibility of income.",
   "file": "20220331_ELCO_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-05-25",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The board remains confident in delivering results in line with market expectations for the full year.",
   "file": "20220525_ELCO_AGM-Statement-and-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-27",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Board remains confident in delivering in line with market expectations for the full year.",
   "file": "20220727_ELCO_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-13",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Importantly, we remain well capitalised and I would like to thank our talented team and valued customers for their support. We remain confident of meeting market expectations for the full year to 31 December 2022.",
   "file": "20220913_ELCO_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-01-24",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "As a result of this transition away from upfront perpetual licences, unaudited revenues for the year ended 31 December 2022 are anticipated to be £26.6m (£27.0m in constant currency terms).  This, together with earnings for the period, is in line with market expectations2.",
   "file": "20230124_ELCO_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-03-28",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We are confident of continued robust progress through 2023 and in meeting market expectations for the year ahead.",
   "file": "20230328_ELCO_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-05-11",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Eleco remains well-positioned for the future and the Board is confident that the Group will deliver in line with market expectations for the full year",
   "file": "20230511_ELCO_AGM-Statement-and-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-07-27",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We are delighted with Eleco's trading performance for the first six months of the financial year, and we remain in line with market expectations for the financial year.",
   "file": "20230727_ELCO_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-09-12",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "We are confident in continued progress and positive momentum for the future, underpinned by our current trading tracking in line with management's expectations for the full year.",
   "file": "20230912_ELCO_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-01-23",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 2,
   "q": "Despite challenging macroeconomic climates and geopolitical uncertainties, Eleco has continued to deliver a robust performance with its underlying revenue growth, and profitability is expected to be ahead of consensus.",
   "file": "20240123_ELCO_Year-end-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-04-23",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "As at 31 March 2024, our ARR was £24.5m. It gives a clear indication of our continued organic growth in recurring revenues. Looking forward, the Group is trading in line with 2024 expectations.",
   "file": "20240423_ELCO_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-06-04",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
